Recommends: python3-pil, python3-reportlab
Description: Lightweight photographic contact sheet generator
 Planche Contact is a simple and fast tool that generates high-quality
 (300 dpi) contact sheets from folders of images.
 .
 It offers a modern GTK4 graphical interface as well as a command-line
 interface.
